    <p style="margin:0 0 24px; color:#333333; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6;">Not yet registered for Manila? The symposium runs from 29 November to 3 December 2026 at The Manila Hotel, co-hosted with the Commission on Elections of the Philippines (COMELEC). Attendance is free and accommodation at The Manila Hotel is covered. You can <a href="https://www.electoralnetwork.org/events/69938de4f4f23e0fef2e3129" style="color:#1a2744;">register here</a>.</p>

